{"seq":2,"slug":"generative-models","title":"生成模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/synthetic-data-generation/methods/generative-models","wordCount":1665,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"生成模型\">生成模型</h1><p>当真实世界的相关性复杂到你写不出规则时，就轮到神经网络出场——让它从真实数据里自己学出那个高维联合分布，再从中采样。这就是深度生成模型的核心承诺：不需要你描述「数据长什么样」，只要给它足够多真实样本，它就能逼近底层分布 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mtext>data</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_{\\text{data}}(x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">data</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，然后吐出统计上以假乱真的新样本。这条路线占据生成机制谱系（见 <a href=\"../foundations/data-types-spectrum\">类型与谱系</a>）的右段，是图像、音频、表格合成的主力。这一篇讲清三大主流架构各自怎么逼近分布、各自的代价。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>深度生成模型的核心承诺是：不需要人描述数据长什么样，只要给它足够多的真实样本，它就能逼近底层分布 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mtext>data</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_{\\text{data}}(x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">data</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，再从中采样出统计上以假乱真的新样本。形式化地，训练目标是最小化学到的分布 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_\\theta(x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 与真实分布 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mtext>data</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_{\\text{data}}(x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">data</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 之间的距离：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><munder><mrow><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mi>θ</mi></munder><mtext>  </mtext><mi>D</mi><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">(</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mtext>data</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∥</mi><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\min_\\theta \\; D\\big(p_{\\text{data}}(x) \\,\\|\\, p_\\theta(x)\\big)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.6021em;vertical-align:-0.7521em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3479em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop\">min</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7521em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">data</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>GAN、VAE、扩散模型正是对这一目标的三条不同求解路径，差别在于用什么方式去逼近、以及用什么损失函数去度量这个距离。理解这条路线，关键是把「逼近分布」这一个抽象目标，映射到三套具体的训练机制上。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>架构</th>\n<th>如何逼近 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mtext>data</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_{\\text{data}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">data</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></th>\n<th>距离度量</th>\n<th>关键超参</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>GAN</td>\n<td>生成器与判别器对抗博弈</td>\n<td>对抗损失（隐式）</td>\n<td>二者能力平衡</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>VAE</td>\n<td>隐变量编码+重构，最大化下界</td>\n<td>ELBO（似然下界）</td>\n<td>正则项权重 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>扩散模型</td>\n<td>学习逐步去噪的反向过程</td>\n<td>每步去噪的回归损失</td>\n<td>去噪步数</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>三者共享同一个抽象目标，因此在同一句话上又各有各的病：逼近得越精确，越可能把训练集里的个体一并记住——这正是它们共同的隐私隐忧。下面的三节依次展开每条路径的机制与代价。</p>\n<h2 id=\"三大架构的核心思想\">三大架构的核心思想</h2><p>GAN、VAE、扩散模型用三种截然不同的方式逼近同一个目标分布。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>架构</th>\n<th>逼近方式</th>\n<th>优势</th>\n<th>主要痛点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>GAN</td>\n<td>生成器与判别器对抗博弈</td>\n<td>样本锐利逼真</td>\n<td>训练不稳、模式崩溃</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>VAE</td>\n<td>隐变量编码+重构，最大化下界</td>\n<td>训练稳定、隐空间可解释</td>\n<td>样本偏模糊</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>扩散模型</td>\n<td>学习逐步去噪的反向过程</td>\n<td>质量与多样性兼优</td>\n<td>采样慢、算力高</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这三者不是谁取代谁。GAN 在 2014 到 2020 年主导，扩散模型在 2021 年后成为图像生成的新王者，而 VAE 因为隐空间性质好仍在很多场景里活跃。理解它们的差异，关键在看它们如何处理「逼真」与「多样」这对矛盾。</p>\n<h2 id=\"gan-对抗博弈\">GAN：对抗博弈</h2><p>生成对抗网络让两个网络互相较劲：生成器 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>G</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span></span></span></span></span> 把随机噪声 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span></span></span></span></span> 映射成假样本，判别器 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span> 努力区分真假，二者在一个极小极大博弈里共同进步：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><munder><mrow><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mi>G</mi></munder><munder><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mi>D</mi></munder><mtext>  </mtext><msub><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">E</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>∼</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mtext>data</mtext></msub></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>+</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">E</mi><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>∼</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>z</mi></msub></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>G</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\min_G \\max_D \\; \\mathbb{E}_{x \\sim p_{\\text{data}}}[\\log D(x)] + \\mathbb{E}_{z \\sim p_z}[\\log(1 - D(G(z)))]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.4943em;vertical-align:-0.7443em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3557em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">G</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop\">min</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7443em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3557em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop\">max</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7443em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbb\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∼</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3488em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">data</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1512em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbb\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∼</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1645em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mclose\">)))]</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>当博弈达到均衡，生成器产出的分布与真实分布无法被区分。GAN 的样本通常非常锐利逼真，这是它的招牌。但对抗训练出了名的难调：两个网络的能力要保持微妙平衡，稍有失衡就训练发散；更棘手的是模式崩溃（mode collapse）——生成器发现只造几种「最容易骗过判别器」的样本就能蒙混过关，于是放弃了真实分布的多样性。这个「只生成少数模式」的退化，和 <a href=\"../practice/risks-model-collapse\">风险与模型崩溃</a> 里 LLM 层面的崩溃是同一种病在不同尺度的体现。针对表格数据的 GAN 变体 CTGAN，是 <a href=\"../tabular-privacy/tabular-synthesis\">表格数据合成</a> 的核心模型之一。</p>\n<h2 id=\"vae-与扩散-从隐空间到去噪\">VAE 与扩散：从隐空间到去噪</h2><p>变分自编码器走的是另一条路：编码器把样本压进一个低维隐空间的概率分布，解码器再从隐空间重构。训练目标是最大化数据似然的证据下界（ELBO），由重构项加上一个把隐分布拉向标准正态的正则项组成。VAE 训练稳定、隐空间连续可插值，但重构项的本质让它的样本偏模糊——它倾向于「平均」而非「锐化」。</p>\n<p>扩散模型则是当下质量与多样性的天花板。它的思路出人意料地简单：定义一个前向过程，逐步往真实样本里加高斯噪声，直到变成纯噪声；再训练一个网络学会反向的去噪过程。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[真实样本 x0] --&gt; B[前向加噪&lt;br/&gt;逐步破坏]&#10;    B --&gt; C[纯高斯噪声 xT]&#10;    C --&gt; D[反向去噪网络&lt;br/&gt;逐步恢复]&#10;    D --&gt; E[生成新样本]&#10;    F[训练: 预测每步噪声] -.-&gt; D&#10;    E --&gt; G{质量足够?}&#10;    G --&gt;|算力换质量| D\">flowchart TD\n    A[真实样本 x0] --&gt; B[前向加噪&lt;br/&gt;逐步破坏]\n    B --&gt; C[纯高斯噪声 xT]\n    C --&gt; D[反向去噪网络&lt;br/&gt;逐步恢复]\n    D --&gt; E[生成新样本]\n    F[训练: 预测每步噪声] -.-&gt; D\n    E --&gt; G{质量足够?}\n    G --&gt;|算力换质量| D</pre><p>生成时，从纯噪声出发，反复应用去噪网络,一步步「雕刻」出清晰样本。扩散模型既避开了 GAN 的训练不稳，又比 VAE 锐利，还天然覆盖多样的模式。代价是采样要走几十到上千步去噪，计算开销大。它在表格上的代表是 TabDDPM，同样在 <a href=\"../tabular-privacy/tabular-synthesis\">表格数据合成</a> 里详述。</p>\n<h2 id=\"共同的隐忧-记忆与隐私\">共同的隐忧：记忆与隐私</h2><p>三种架构有一个共享的危险:它们都可能记忆训练样本。当模型容量过剩或训练数据稀少，生成器会把某些真实样本几乎原样背下来，采样时直接吐出——这就把 <a href=\"../foundations/fidelity-privacy-tradeoff\">保真度与隐私的权衡</a> 里描述的泄露风险变成现实。研究已多次证明，从扩散模型和 GAN 中能通过特定攻击「抽取」出训练图像，包括真实人脸。</p>\n<p>这意味着用深度生成模型造涉及个人的数据时，光看样本逼真远远不够，必须主动评估泄露。要么在训练时引入差分隐私约束（见 <a href=\"../tabular-privacy/differential-privacy-synthesis\">差分隐私合成</a>），要么事后用成员推断攻击审计（见 <a href=\"../tabular-privacy/evaluation-fidelity-utility\">评估保真与效用</a>）。逼真与安全在这条路线上是要同时盯住的两件事。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>深度生成模型让神经网络从真实数据学出高维联合分布，捕捉规则写不出的复杂相关性。</li>\n<li>GAN 锐利但训练不稳、易模式崩溃；VAE 稳定但偏模糊；扩散模型质量与多样性最优但采样慢。</li>\n<li>三者的演进是「逼真」与「多样」矛盾的不同解法，并非简单的新旧替代。</li>\n<li>共同隐忧是记忆训练样本导致隐私泄露，必须配合差分隐私或攻击审计，不能只看样本逼真。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"生成模型","id":"生成模型"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"三大架构的核心思想","id":"三大架构的核心思想"},{"level":2,"text":"GAN：对抗博弈","id":"gan-对抗博弈"},{"level":2,"text":"VAE 与扩散：从隐空间到去噪","id":"vae-与扩散-从隐空间到去噪"},{"level":2,"text":"共同的隐忧：记忆与隐私","id":"共同的隐忧-记忆与隐私"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"基于规则与仿真","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/synthetic-data-generation/methods/rule-based-simulation"},"next":{"title":"LLM 驱动的合成与蒸馏","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/synthetic-data-generation/methods/llm-driven-generation"}}